4. HOW WE VERIFY WHICH BINARY WE TESTED AGAINST
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Reports under extensions/docs/ record the exact build used for each round of
measurements. Binaries are identified by SHA-256 rather than by file name,
because the file name carries no version information:

  v0.14.0 windows-x64 : 6697a8962f148628f11d93b36960235871de5614905d6a27c55341c2b83f4118
  v0.15.0 windows-x64 : a1f67dd917c5731f88399e1671ebe4f6959d2fd520c78dcaa1faf3ad37ea9518

Always prefer the official release page over any mirror.

